# Trostani, Three Whispers: "{G/W}: Target creature gains vigilance until end of turn." The hybrid cost is paid with green here (the other
# scenario pays it with white), and an opponent's creature may be the target: Bot2's Grizzly Bears gains vigilance, and loses it again
# when Bot1's turn ends, so it has none on Bot2's turn 4.

